  "releaseNotes": "## v1.5.5 (patch)\n\nChanges since v1.5.4:\n\n- Refuse an attached switch as a value option's value [patch] (#106) (matt-edmondson)\n- Record a throwing status or toggle getter instead of letting it escape the refresh [patch] (#107) (matt-edmondson)\n- Check both tray icon resources before the tool starts [patch] (#108) (matt-edmondson)",
